# What the Mac app's bundled Python needs: Pyxi's and Otto's dependencies (installer.in without
# the Windows-only ones) plus the Apple frameworks through pyobjc. Otto and Pyxi themselves come
# from the local checkouts (scripts/build_mac.py).
#
# Not hash-locked yet: lock it on a Mac with
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes requirements/mac.in -o requirements/mac.txt
# and build_mac.py installs from mac.txt with --require-hashes once it exists.
#
# Developing on a Mac: pip install -e . -r requirements/mac.in
